[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8963.71, "timestamp": "02:29:23", "text": "晚上，呃，等一下。這裡是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8964.83, "timestamp": "02:29:24", "text": "不，不，不，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8967.07, "timestamp": "02:29:27", "text": "娜醬，事情就是這樣，事情就是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8976.469, "timestamp": "02:29:36", "text": "它的形狀是這樣的，對吧？死亡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8978.63, "timestamp": "02:29:38", "text": "我明白。啊，你說得對。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8984.91, "timestamp": "02:29:44", "text": "啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8988.79, "timestamp": "02:29:48", "text": "這就是為什麼我只理解第二題的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8991.71, "timestamp": "02:29:51", "text": "我懂了。接上文第123條。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8993.15, "timestamp": "02:29:53", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8994.91, "timestamp": "02:29:54", "text": "我懂了。我懂了。我懂了。"}]